  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Database Solutions**\n\nI\'m currently focused on addressing the absence of a local PostgreSQL daemon within this container. My plan is to implement a robust database abstraction layer, complete with SQL migration files to ensure a clean and manageable setup. I think this will work really well!\n\n\n**Defining Database Components**\n\nI\'ve made progress on defining the database components. I\'m now drafting the schema and Docker Compose file for a production PostgreSQL deployment. Simultaneously, I\'m working on the Node.js server. I\'m building a transactional storage engine that precisely mirrors the PostgreSQL schema, including migrations for seamless external Postgres connections. I\'m also examining and installing Node.js packages like Zod for request validation, and checking the `package.json` scripts to see how the server can be started.\n\n\n"
