  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into the UI components, starting with `src/components/Navbar.tsx`. I\'m focusing on the \"Interview Arena\" brand logo, a live status badge for \"LIVE DEV\", and an active user profile switcher. The switcher will facilitate quick transitions between user roles: Candidate Deepanshu, Interviewer Sarah, Applicant Alex, and Admin. I will also incorporate the Role Switch feature.\n\n\n**Designing Dashboard Components**\n\nI\'ve moved on to designing more UI elements. Now, I\'m focusing on the CandidateDashboard.tsx. I am working on a dynamic hero banner and the Live Queue Status Card, providing real-time data like position in queue and estimated wait time. I am also working on the recommended pathways selection, as well as upcoming and past interviews sections that include meeting links, scores, and reports. Finally, I\'m developing a stats summary showcasing practice hours and readiness scores. Next is the CatalogView.tsx.\n\n\n**Developing Checkout Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating the checkout functionality. I\'ve designed a detailed round drawer with topics, rubric criteria, and pricing, with a \"Book Practice Round\" button to open the checkout. The checkout modal will show a transparent order summary with base price, platform fee breakdown, and total. I\'m building booking options for immediate queue or scheduled sessions, with a clear refund policy. I\'m also implementing a Razorpay test-mode gateway with simulated payments, server order initiation, signature simulation, backend verification, queue entry creation, and ledger recording!\n\n\n**Building Interviewer Features**\n\nI\'m now deep in the interviewer side. I\'ve integrated a real-time queue radar with candidate filters and one-click interview claims which is atomic. I\'m also building out an earnings card with payout options, including a simulation for UPI/NEFT. I am also working on an availability scheduler, and an application landing page for prospective interviewers.\n\n\n**Crafting Interview Workspace**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the `SessionWorkspace.tsx`. I\'ve outlined a structured interview workspace, complete with session headers displaying essential details. I am developing an integrated Google Meet area with a \"Join Google Meet\" button. I am implementing a live countdown timer and an interviewer evaluation checklist. I\'m also constructing a private interviewer scratchpad and notes section. The structured feedback rubric is coming along well, with criterion-based ratings, written feedback fields, and a recommended next-round verdict. This is designed to instantly update the platform. Finally, I\'ve incorporated dispute and report problem options.\n\n\n**Defining Admin Dashboard**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the admin dashboard, breaking it down by tabs: Overview Analytics, User Management, Interviewer Applications, Catalog & Tier Pricing, Queue & Bookings Operations, Financial & Refunds, Disputes & Reports, Audit Logs, and System Settings. I\'m prioritizing the structure, content, and functionality for each tab, focusing on features like live platform metrics, user role changes, application review with scoring, and dispute resolution.\n\n\\n\\n\n\nI\'m also building policy modals, including Terms of Service, Refund & Cancellation, Privacy Policy, and FAQ/Platform Disclaimer.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1295139"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useEffect } from \'react\';\\nimport { User, NotificationItem } from \'../types\';\\nimport { api, setCurrentUser } from \'../services/api\';\\nimport {\\n  ShieldAlert,\\n  Users,\\n  Compass,\\n  Briefcase,\\n  Layers,\\n  Bell,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  Clock,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  ChevronDown,\\n  LogOut,\\n  HelpCircle,\\n  FileText,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface NavbarProps {\\n  currentUser: User | null;\\n  onUserChange: (user: User) => void;\\n  activeTab: string;\\n  setActiveTab: (tab: string) => void;\\n  activeQueueCount: number;\\n  onOpenPolicies: (policy: \'terms\' | \'refund\' | \'privacy\' | \'faq\') => void;\\n  onOpenQueueTracker: () => void;\\n  hasActiveQueue: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Navbar: React.FC<NavbarProps> = ({\\n  currentUser,\\n  onUserChange,\\n  activeTab,\\n  setActiveTab,\\n  activeQueueCount,\\n  onOpenPolicies,\\n  onOpenQueueTracker,\\n  hasActiveQueue,\\n}) => {\\n  const [showUserMenu, setShowUserMenu] = useState(false);\\n  const [showNotifMenu, setShowNotifMenu] = useState(false);\\n  const [notifications, setNotifications] = useState<NotificationItem[]>([]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    fetchNotifications();\\n    const interval = setInterval(fetchNotifications, 10000);\\n    return () => clearInterval(interval);\\n  }, [currentUser?.id]);\\n\\n  const fetchNotifications = async () => {\\n    try {\\n      const res = await api.getNotifications();\\n      setNotifications(res.notifications || []);\\n    } catch {\\n      // ignore\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleRoleSwitch = async (role: \'CANDIDATE\' | \'INTERVIEWER\' | \'ADMIN\') => {\\n    try {\\n      const res = await api.switchRole(role);\\n      setCurrentUser(res.user.id, role);\\n      onUserChange(res.user);\\n      if (role === \'CANDIDATE\') setActiveTab(\'candidate-dashboard\');\\n      else if (role === \'INTERVIEWER\') setActiveTab(\'interviewer-dashboard\');\\n      else if (role === \'ADMIN\') setActiveTab(\'admin-dashboard\');\\n      setShowUserMenu(false);\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      alert(err.message);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleQuickUserSwitch = async (userId: string, role: string) => {\\n    try {\\n      setCurrentUser(userId, role);\\n      const res = await api.getMe();\\n      onUserChange(res.user);\\n      if (role === \'CANDIDATE\') setActiveTab(\'candidate-dashboard\');\\n      else if (role === \'INTERVIEWER\') setActiveTab(\'interviewer-dashboard\');\\n      else if (role === \'ADMIN\') setActiveTab(\'admin-dashboard\');\\n      setShowUserMenu(false);\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      alert(err.message);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  const unreadCount = notifications.filter((n) => !n.isRead).length;\\n\\n  const handleMarkAllRead = async () => {\\n    await api.markAllNotificationsRead();\\n    setNotifications((prev) => prev.map((n) => ({ ...n, isRead: true })));\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-50 bg-slate-900/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-slate-800 text-slate-100\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n        {/* Brand & Live Badge */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-6\\\">\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'candidate-dashboard\')}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3 text-left focus:outline-none\\\"\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-600 via-indigo-500 to-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20\\\">\\n              IA\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-100 to-slate-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent\\\">\\n                  Interview Arena\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30\\\">\\n                  LIVE\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 hidden sm:block\\\">\\n                Tier-based Mock Interviews \342\200\242 Real Matchmaking\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Nav links */}\\n          <nav className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-1\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'catalog\')}\\n              className={`px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition ${\\n                activeTab === \'catalog\'\\n                  ? \'bg-slate-800 text-indigo-400\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800/60\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5\\\">\\n                <Layers className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                <span>Interview Tracks</span>\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'candidate-dashboard\')}\\n              className={`px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition ${\\n                activeTab === \'candidate-dashboard\'\\n                  ? \'bg-slate-800 text-indigo-400\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800/60\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5\\\">\\n                <Compass className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                <span>Candidate Arena</span>\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'interviewer-dashboard\')}\\n              className={`px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition ${\\n                activeTab === \'interviewer-dashboard\'\\n                  ? \'bg-slate-800 text-amber-400\'\\n                  : \'text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800/60\'\\n              }`}\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5\\\">\\n                <Briefcase className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                <span>Interviewer Portal</span>\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {currentUser?.roles.includes(\'ADMIN\') && (\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setActiveTab(\'admin-dashboard\')}\\n                className={`px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium transition ${\\n                  activeTab === \'admin-dashboard\'\\n                    ? \'bg-slate-800 text-rose-400\'\\n                    : \'text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800/60\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <span className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5\\\">\\n                  <ShieldAlert className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n                  <span>Admin Panel</span>\\n                </span>\\n              </button>\\n            )}\\n          </nav>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Right side tools */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-3\\\">\\n          {/* Active Queue pill */}\\n          {hasActiveQueue ? (\\n            <button\\n              onClick={onOpenQueueTracker}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-500/20 text-xs font-semibold animate-pulse transition\\\"\\n            >\\n              <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400\\\" />\\n              <span>You are in Queue</span>\\n            </button>\\n          ) : activeQueueCount > 0 ? (\\n            <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-2 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-medium\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 animate-ping\\\" />\\n              <span>{activeQueueCount} in Queue</span>\\n            </div>\\n          ) : null}\\n\\n          {/* Notifications Dropdown */}\\n          <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setShowNotifMenu(!showNotifMenu)}\\n              className=\\\"relative p-2 rounded-lg text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 transition\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Notifications\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Bell className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              {unreadCount > 0 && (\\n                <span className=\\\"absolute top-1.5 right-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-rose-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                  {unreadCount}\\n                </span>\\n              )}\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {showNotifMenu && (\\n              <div className=\\\"absolute right-0 mt-2 w-80 sm:w-96 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl shadow-2xl py-2 z-50\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"px-4 py-2 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\\\">Notifications</span>\\n                  {unreadCount > 0 && (\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={handleMarkAllRead}\\n                      className=\\\"text-xs text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Mark all as read\\n                    </button>\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"max-h-80 overflow-y-auto divide-y divide-slate-800/60\\\">\\n                  {notifications.length === 0 ? (\\n                    <div className=\\\"p-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n                      No notifications yet\\n                    </div>\\n                  ) : (\\n                    notifications.map((n) => (\\n                      <div\\n                        key={n.id}\\n                        className={`p-3.5 text-xs transition ${\\n                          n.isRead ? \'bg-slate-900 text-slate-400\' : \'bg-slate-800/50 text-slate-200\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-start justify-between\\\">\\n                          <span className=\\\"font-semibold text-white text-xs\\\">{n.title}</span>\\n                          <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-500\\\">\\n                            {new Date(n.createdAt).toLocaleTimeString([], { hour: \'2-digit\', minute: \'2-digit\' })}\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <p className=\\\"mt-1 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\\\">{n.message}</p>\\n                      </div>\\n                    ))\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* User Persona & Switcher Dropdown */}\\n          <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => setShowUserMenu(!showUserMenu)}\\n              className=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2.5 p-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 bg-slate-800/50 hover:bg-slate-800 transition\\\"\\n            >\\n              <img\\n                src={currentUser?.avatarUrl || \'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=100&q=80\'}\\n                alt={currentUser?.fullName || \'User\'}\\n                className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg object-cover border border-slate-700\\\"\\n              />\\n              <div className=\\\"text-left hidden sm:block pr-1\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"text-xs font-semibold text-white leading-tight\\\">\\n                  {currentUser?.fullName || \'User\'}\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-wider font-bold\\\">\\n                  {currentUser?.activeRole || \'CANDIDATE\'}\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <ChevronDown className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            {showUserMenu && (\\n              <div className=\\\"absolute right-0 mt-2 w-72 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl shadow-2xl py-2 z-50\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"px-4 py-3 border-b border-slate-800\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-white\\\">{currentUser?.fullName}</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 truncate\\\">{currentUser?.email}</div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"mt-2 flex items-center space-x-1.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\\\">Current Role:</span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-500/30\\\">\\n                      {currentUser?.activeRole}\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Role Switcher */}\\n                <div className=\\\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5 px-1\\\">\\n                    Switch Active Role\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-1\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => handleRoleSwitch(\'CANDIDATE\')}\\n                      className={`text-xs py-1.5 rounded font-medium transition ${\\n                        currentUser?.activeRole === \'CANDIDATE\'\\n                          ? \'bg-indigo-600 text-white font-semibold\'\\n                          : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      Candidate\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => handleRoleSwitch(\'INTERVIEWER\')}\\n                      className={`text-xs py-1.5 rounded font-medium transition ${\\n                        currentUser?.activeRole === \'INTERVIEWER\'\\n                          ? \'bg-amber-600 text-white font-semibold\'\\n                          : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      Interviewer\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => handleRoleSwitch(\'ADMIN\')}\\n                      className={`text-xs py-1.5 rounded font-medium transition ${\\n                        currentUser?.activeRole === \'ADMIN\'\\n                          ? \'bg-rose-600 text-white font-semibold\'\\n                          : \'bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700\'\\n                      }`}\\n                    >\\n                      Admin\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Quick Persona Switcher for effortless testing */}\\n                <div className=\\\"px-3 py-2 border-b border-slate-800\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5 px-1\\\">\\n                    Switch Demo Persona\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"space-y-1\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => handleQuickUserSwitch(\'usr_candidate_1\', \'CANDIDATE\')}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full text-left px-2 py-1.5 rounded text-xs text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <span>Deepanshu (Candidate)</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-indigo-400\\\">Student</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => handleQuickUserSwitch(\'usr_interviewer_1\', \'INTERVIEWER\')}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full text-left px-2 py-1.5 rounded text-xs text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <span>Sarah Chen (Approved Interviewer)</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-amber-400\\\">Ex-Google L5</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => handleQuickUserSwitch(\'usr_applicant_1\', \'INTERVIEWER\')}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full text-left px-2 py-1.5 rounded text-xs text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <span>Alex Morgan (Applicant)</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-yellow-400\\\">Screening</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => handleQuickUserSwitch(\'usr_admin_1\', \'ADMIN\')}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full text-left px-2 py-1.5 rounded text-xs text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <span>Admin (Full Access)</span>\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[10px] text-rose-400\\\">Super Admin</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Policy Links */}\\n                <div className=\\\"px-3 py-1.5 border-b border-slate-800\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setShowUserMenu(false);\\n                      onOpenPolicies(\'refund\');\\n                    }}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full text-left px-2 py-1.5 rounded text-xs text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center space-x-2\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <FileText className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                    <span>Refund & Cancellation Policy</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                  <button\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setShowUserMenu(false);\\n                      onOpenPolicies(\'faq\');\\n                    }}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full text-left px-2 py-1.5 rounded text-xs text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-800 flex items-center space-x-2\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <HelpCircle className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                    <span>FAQ & Support</span>\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"px-3 pt-1.5 pb-1\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    onClick={() => {\\n                      setActiveTab(\'become-interviewer\');\\n                      setShowUserMenu(false);\\n                    }}\\n                    className=\\\"w-full text-center py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-amber-500 text-white hover:opacity-90 transition\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    Become an Interviewer (Earn 80%)\\n                  </button>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create responsive Navbar with role switcher, persona switcher, real-time queue pill, and notifications\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Navbar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing file\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create Navbar component\"}"
