              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202  - 0001_initial_schema.sql (18 Relational Tables)      \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202  - Foreign Keys, Indexes, UUIDs, Triggers              \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "```"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 3. Atomic Concurrency & Matchmaking Queue"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "The matchmaking queue guarantees **strict FIFO ordering** and **atomic single-assignment**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "1. **Candidate Booking Fulfillment**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Once a payment is confirmed via webhook or signature verification, exactly **one** queue entry is created with status `WAITING` and a configurable timeout (default: 15 mins)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "2. **Atomic Acceptance**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - When an approved interviewer clicks \"Accept & Claim\", the server acquires a row-level mutex lock on `bookingId`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - The transaction verifies that:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     1. The session is currently in `QUEUED` / `WAITING` status."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     2. The interviewer is `APPROVED`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     3. The interviewer is qualified for the target tier (`TIER_A`, `TIER_B`, or `TIER_C`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "     4. The interviewer does not have another active overlapping session in `CLAIMED` or `IN_PROGRESS` state."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - If two interviewers submit acceptance at the exact same millisecond, only the first transaction succeeds. The second receives an explicit HTTP 409 conflict message: *\"This interview request is currently being claimed by another interviewer.\"*"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "3. **Queue Timeouts**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - A background sweep checks for waiting sessions past `timeoutAt`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "   - Unclaimed sessions are automatically cancelled and a 100% full refund is issued to the candidate."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 4. Immutable Accounting Ledger"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "The platform treats financial consistency as mission-critical. Historical entries are never updated; all adjustments are recorded via append-only ledger entries:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- `PAYMENT_RECEIVED`: Credited when candidate payment is captured (e.g. +\342\202\271100)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- `PLATFORM_COMMISSION`: Platform revenue retained upon session completion (20%, e.g. +\342\202\27120)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- `INTERVIEWER_CREDIT`: Interviewer earnings credited upon rubric submission (80%, e.g. +\342\202\27180)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- `REFUND_DEBIT`: Debited when session is cancelled or timed out (-\342\202\271100)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- `PAYOUT_DEBIT`: Debited when interviewer withdraws available balance to UPI/Bank (-\342\202\27180)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "---"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "## 5. Meeting Integration Strategy"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Google Calendar API**: When `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` and `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET` are provided, the system creates calendar events with Google Meet conference data."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Development Fallback Sandbox**: When Google OAuth credentials are not provided in the environment, the platform clearly labels the fallback and provisions an encrypted sandbox room (`https://meet.jit.si/InterviewArena-<ref>`), ensuring the end-to-end user workflow can be immediately tested and used."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
          }
        }
        absolute_uri: "file:///ARCHITECTURE.md"
        create_file: true
      }
    }
    use_fast_apply: true
    description: "Create ARCHITECTURE.md detailing component design, concurrency locks, and ledger rules"
    diff_stats {
      additions: 79
    }
  }
}
