  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Drafting README.md Content**\n\nI\'m currently structuring the `README.md` file. I\'ve broken down the content into the main sections: repository structure, setup and run commands, seed accounts, Razorpay integration, Google Meet configuration, email setup, and testing results. I\'m focusing on clarity and ease of use for the user. I\'ll make sure to provide exact commands and instructions.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_813192"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"# Interview Arena \342\200\224 Complete Full-Stack Web Application\\n\\n**Interview Arena** is a complete, production-grade mock interview marketplace and live practice platform. Job seekers and students can book and practice live technical interviews with vetted peers and industry professionals across Tier A (\342\202\271100), Tier B (\342\202\27180), and Tier C (\342\202\27160) company preparation pathways.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Quick Start\\n\\n### Prerequisites\\n- Node.js 20+\\n- npm\\n\\n### Installation & Run\\n```bash\\n# 1. Install dependencies\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 2. Run automated tests (Unit, Concurrency, and E2E)\\nnpm test\\n\\n# 3. Start development server\\nnpm run dev\\n```\\n\\nThe application will start on **http://localhost:3000** with hot reloading and full-stack Express API routes active.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Demo Seed Accounts\\n\\nThe platform comes pre-seeded with four dedicated personas to effortlessly test all roles without manual registration:\\n\\n| Role | User Persona | Email | Description |\\n|------|-------------|-------|-------------|\\n| **Candidate** | Deepanshu Chawla | `deepanshu.chawla2608@gmail.com` | CS student targeting FAANG SDE roles, 3 completed sessions |\\n| **Interviewer (Approved)** | Sarah Chen | `sarah.lead@interviewer.com` | Ex-Google L5, verified for Tier A/B/C, 4.9 rating, active balance |\\n| **Interviewer (Applicant)** | Alex Morgan | `alex.dev@applicant.com` | SDE II, completed Screening 1, awaiting Screening 2 & Admin decision |\\n| **Super Admin** | System Administrator | `admin@interviewarena.com` | Full platform control, metrics, ledger, tier pricing, and refunds |\\n\\n> **Pro Tip:** Use the **User Avatar Menu** in the top navigation bar to instantaneously switch between personas or roles with a single click.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Core Features Implemented\\n\\n1. **Tier-Based Preparation Tracks & Configurable Rounds**:\\n   - **Tier A (\342\202\271100)**: Top-tier tech preparation (Google, Meta, Amazon, Microsoft, Uber). 5 rounds covering OA screening, non-linear algorithms, advanced DP, distributed system design, and behavioral leadership.\\n   - **Tier B (\342\202\27180)**: Established high-growth and FinTech tracks. 3 rounds covering CS fundamentals, SQL schemas, framework architecture, and past project deep-dives.\\n   - **Tier C (\342\202\27160)**: Campus placement and junior engineering tracks. 2 rounds covering OOP fundamentals, basic loops, and HR readiness.\\n2. **Atomic Queue & Matchmaking Engine**:\\n   - Real-time FIFO queue with Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming at `/api/queue/stream`.\\n   - **Row-level mutex lock**: guarantees that when two interviewers click \\\"Accept & Claim\\\" simultaneously, exactly one transaction succeeds. The second receives an explicit HTTP 409 conflict.\\n   - Overlap prevention: interviewers cannot claim overlapping sessions.\\n   - Automatic 15-minute queue timeout with automatic 100% full refund.\\n3. **Payments & Immutable Accounting Ledger**:\\n   - Server-side price validation (prices in client requests are ignored).\\n   - Razorpay test-mode gateway integration with test cards and UPI.\\n   - Immutable append-only ledger tracking `PAYMENT_RECEIVED`, `PLATFORM_COMMISSION` (20%), `INTERVIEWER_CREDIT` (80%), `REFUND_DEBIT`, and `PAYOUT_DEBIT`.\\n   - Transparent payout request workflow with simulated NEFT/UPI transfers.\\n4. **Interviewer 2-Stage Screening Process**:\\n   - \\\"Become an Interviewer\\\" application pipeline.\\n   - Requires completion of Screening Interview 1 (Coding) and Screening Interview 2 (Behavioral Rubric).\\n   - Admin evaluation dashboard to record scores and grant approval.\\n5. **Session Workspace & Post-Interview Rubrics**:\\n   - Dedicated meeting workspace with live video connectivity.\\n   - Live countdown timer with Start, Pause, and Reset.\\n   - Interview execution checklist.\\n   - Private interviewer evaluation scratchpad.\\n   - Shared problem and code scratchpad.\\n   - Multi-criteria structured feedback rubric: Problem Understanding, Optimal Complexity, Code Cleanliness, Edge Cases, and Communication.\\n   - Candidate 1\342\200\2235 star rating and review.\\n   - Problem / Dispute reporting mechanism.\\n6. **Super Admin Dashboard (Mandatory)**:\\n   - Database-backed live metrics (Gross Volume, Platform Revenue, Interviewer Liabilities, Timeouts).\\n   - User management with suspension and audit logs.\\n   - Tier price configuration (edit Tier A \342\202\271100, Tier B \342\202\27180, Tier C \342\202\27160).\\n   - Round curriculum management.\\n   - Live queue and booking monitor with manual overrides.\\n   - Refund approval/rejection with automatic ledger balance debit.\\n   - Dispute resolution.\\n   - System settings and integration health status.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. Integration Setup\\n\\n### Payment Gateway (Razorpay)\\n1. Sign up at [dashboard.razorpay.com](https://dashboard.razorpay.com).\\n2. Go to **Settings -> API Keys** and generate Test Keys.\\n3. Copy `Key Id` and `Key Secret` to `.env`:\\n   ```bash\\n   RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=\\\"rzp_test_...\\\"\\n   RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=\\\"your_secret_here\\\"\\n   ```\\n4. Configure Webhooks pointing to `https://<YOUR_APP_URL>/api/payments/webhook`.\\n\\n### Google Calendar & Meet Integration\\n1. Open [Google Cloud Console](https://console.cloud.google.com).\\n2. Create or select a project and enable the **Google Calendar API**.\\n3. Create OAuth 2.0 Credentials (Web Application) and add your redirect URI:\\n   `https://<YOUR_APP_URL>/api/auth/google/callback`\\n4. Set credentials in `.env`:\\n   ```bash\\n   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=\\\"your_google_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com\\\"\\n   GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=\\\"your_google_client_secret\\\"\\n   ```\\n5. *Note: If Google Meet credentials are not set, Interview Arena cleanly falls back to an encrypted real-time video sandbox with transparent UI labeling.*\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. Docker & Production Deployment\\n\\nTo run with PostgreSQL using Docker Compose:\\n```bash\\ndocker-compose up --build\\n```\\nThis automatically boots PostgreSQL 16 on port 5432, executes `migrations/0001_initial_schema.sql`, builds the production frontend, and starts the containerized service on port 3000.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. Automated Testing\\n\\nRun the test suite with:\\n```bash\\nnpm test\\n```\\nThe test suite validates:\\n- Tier pricing and 20% platform commission calculation\\n- Append-only ledger accounting rules\\n- Concurrency and atomic queue claim locks (rejection of duplicate acceptance)\\n- Qualification checks (unapproved applicants cannot claim paid sessions)\\n- End-to-end booking -> payment -> matching -> feedback -> financial reconciliation\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create comprehensive README.md documentation for Interview Arena\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/README.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing file\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create README.md\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\342\004\n\337\004\001i\024}\023\201_\262\n\322\307\231\350\317\205\022\306H\2379\343\001\334\353X\345\231\333\241\025D\367\265\024\367\356\220\021b?\243\214\206k\004V\264\373h\255sF4\037\314\321I\224\274!\217\263\t\264\246\365G\354\277\210\264\330\224Qy\341\302\037\333\036\255\223\227\367S\206\274\255\360\234\315\247\034\332z\316Q5\037\242jd\276\355a\n\306S\305FX\352L\270z\v4\227C\230\353\346\355\241\213e\254\032>J\001\301\212\303N\347>D_h\305\021}\324;t\"\221\375/Q0\334\177W(\025\rA8\321\216[P\316\310(\2407\267\034\363~H2z\310\221\001\372\364\332\315\234\213t\234\260\2663\0315$\205Vk\3318\254\310\323\275\315\361\316\211\307\220l\374.\365\350$R\030\2174\344DW\365NF\362\375\273\272<\247t\353\246f\355\254\332\355\256\332\003\351\004\262\226\232R\360km\274/\352\331K\2414\325(\341\031?\004\031\375\237)u\202YP\322~;Y\270\343p0\3305\226\331\307\325\207|\at[\374\233\203t\260N\366c\340\312\250\235\242\370@ZFH\271\025\236\210s\321\350v\n\251\376\022\031)bMeM_\221\2749\257\342\261\022\"\211\236\321\326<\320kT\331!`\366\326\177d\374W!sgJ\311\020\325e^x_f\221m\r<\031\321_~\324\005\362\t\224W\267]\223\212\217}\250o\313\255e\207\a\2522/\250\270!\324WiA\251\037\267\361\360TrUWxA>\025\214\225\251\331\f~\360\226,\322\307vY\217\263\236]\365\020\305\310/\n\021Zb\024U\214\fq-\324O\361\226y\331rR\317#\004W$\340o\\V4\026\237\310\267vf\017J\2364\314\314@\277\365\314\243\303\342!#\017\277\020\251\035\"(\214\340\226B\245\2110\021>\272\177\244v\262\255\303\370\325m\024\212l\\\320\304\334\324\277\002$z\271s>\322\260\022\306`o\302hA\234\024\245\265|\372\r\342+\232\023\346K\376\332\335\354\202x\205\254\253V#}&6C\"\023y\321\341\322\376)\177D\233|\245\2202\341\311\242\213g\005\362\215rey\021(L\246A\304:zj\345\254\273\305\017\344\253 ."
