  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Light Theme CSS**\n\nI\'ve begun implementing light theme CSS overrides within `src/index.css`.  I\'m focusing on ensuring cards, input fields, and text render with high contrast and visual clarity when the `.light` class is applied to the `html` element.  This is based on the use of `color-scheme: light` when the html.light class is applied to the HTML.\n\n\n**Refining Light Theme Adjustments**\n\nI\'ve made substantial progress refining the light theme overrides. I\'ve now defined background, text, and border colors for the `.light` class, including those for headers, various background colors, and common text styles. I\'m ensuring all colors provide strong contrasts for readability. I\'ve focused on overriding the specific Tailwind classes for a seamless user experience.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1454916"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\nhtml.light {\\n  color-scheme: light;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.dark {\\n  color-scheme: dark;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light body {\\n  background-color: #f8fafc;\\n  color: #0f172a;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light header {\\n  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95) !important;\\n  border-color: #e2e8f0 !important;\\n  color: #0f172a !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light .bg-slate-900 {\\n  background-color: #ffffff !important;\\n  border-color: #e2e8f0 !important;\\n  color: #0f172a !important;\\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light .bg-slate-950 {\\n  background-color: #f8fafc !important;\\n  border-color: #e2e8f0 !important;\\n  color: #0f172a !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light .bg-slate-800 {\\n  background-color: #f1f5f9 !important;\\n  border-color: #cbd5e1 !important;\\n  color: #1e293b !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light .bg-slate-800\\\\/60,\\nhtml.light .bg-slate-800\\\\/50,\\nhtml.light .bg-slate-800\\\\/40 {\\n  background-color: #f1f5f9 !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light .text-white {\\n  color: #0f172a !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light .text-slate-300,\\nhtml.light .text-slate-200 {\\n  color: #334155 !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light .text-slate-400 {\\n  color: #64748b !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light .border-slate-800,\\nhtml.light .border-slate-700 {\\n  border-color: #e2e8f0 !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light input,\\nhtml.light select,\\nhtml.light textarea {\\n  background-color: #ffffff !important;\\n  border-color: #cbd5e1 !important;\\n  color: #0f172a !important;\\n}\\n\\nhtml.light footer {\\n  background-color: #f8fafc !important;\\n  border-color: #e2e8f0 !important;\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Add light theme styling overrides for high-contrast, clean appearance in index.css\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing file\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add light theme styles\"}"
