  view_file {
    absolute_path_uri: "file:///README.md"
    end_line: 59
    content: "# Interview Arena \342\200\224 Complete Full-Stack Web Application\n\n**Interview Arena** is a complete, production-grade mock interview marketplace and live practice platform. Job seekers and students can book and practice live technical interviews with vetted peers and industry professionals across Tier A (\342\202\271100), Tier B (\342\202\27180), and Tier C (\342\202\27160) company preparation pathways.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Quick Start\n\n### Prerequisites\n- Node.js 20+\n- npm\n\n### Installation & Run\n```bash\n# 1. Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# 2. Run automated tests (Unit, Concurrency, and E2E)\nnpm test\n\n# 3. Start development server\nnpm run dev\n```\n\nThe application will start on **http://localhost:3000** with hot reloading and full-stack Express API routes active.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Demo Seed Accounts\n\nThe platform comes pre-seeded with four dedicated personas to effortlessly test all roles without manual registration:\n\n| Role | User Persona | Email | Description |\n|------|-------------|-------|-------------|\n| **Candidate** | Deepanshu Chawla | `deepanshu.chawla2608@gmail.com` | CS student targeting FAANG SDE roles, 3 completed sessions |\n| **Interviewer (Approved)** | Sarah Chen | `sarah.lead@interviewer.com` | Ex-Google L5, verified for Tier A/B/C, 4.9 rating, active balance |\n| **Interviewer (Applicant)** | Alex Morgan | `alex.dev@applicant.com` | SDE II, completed Screening 1, awaiting Screening 2 & Admin decision |\n| **Super Admin** | System Administrator | `admin@interviewarena.com` | Full platform control, metrics, ledger, tier pricing, and refunds |\n\n> **Pro Tip:** Use the **User Avatar Menu** in the top navigation bar to instantaneously switch between personas or roles with a single click.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Core Features Implemented\n\n1. **Tier-Based Preparation Tracks & Configurable Rounds**:\n   - **Tier A (\342\202\271100)**: Top-tier tech preparation (Google, Meta, Amazon, Microsoft, Uber). 5 rounds covering OA screening, non-linear algorithms, advanced DP, distributed system design, and behavioral leadership.\n   - **Tier B (\342\202\27180)**: Established high-growth and FinTech tracks. 3 rounds covering CS fundamentals, SQL schemas, framework architecture, and past project deep-dives.\n   - **Tier C (\342\202\27160)**: Campus placement and junior engineering tracks. 2 rounds covering OOP fundamentals, basic loops, and HR readiness.\n2. **Atomic Queue & Matchmaking Engine**:\n   - Real-time FIFO queue with Server-Sent Events (SSE) streaming at `/api/queue/stream`.\n   - **Row-level mutex lock**: guarantees that when two interviewers click \"Accept & Claim\" simultaneously, exactly one transaction succeeds. The second receives an explicit HTTP 409 conflict.\n   - Overlap prevention: interviewers cannot claim overlapping sessions.\n   - Automatic 15-minute queue timeout with automatic 100% full refund.\n3. **Payments & Immutable Accounting Ledger**:\n   - Server-side price validation (prices in client requests are ignored).\n   - Razorpay test-mode gateway integration with test cards and UPI.\n   - Immutable append-only ledger tracking `PAYMENT_RECEIVED`, `PLATFORM_COMMISSION` (20%), `INTERVIEWER_CREDIT` (80%), `REFUND_DEBIT`, and `PAYOUT_DEBIT`.\n   - Transparent payout request workflow with simulated NEFT/UPI transfers.\n4. **Interviewer 2-Stage Screening Process**:"
    num_lines: 133
    num_bytes: 6299
    line_range_bytes: 3244
  }
}
