  planner_response {
    response: "### Summary of Delivered Features\n\nAll requested integrations have been fully implemented, verified, and tested:\n\n#### 1. MongoDB Integration\n* **Client & Manager (`src/db/mongodb.ts`)**: Configured connection pooling, collections (`users`, `bookings`, `queue_entries`, `ledger`, `tiers`), and unique indexes.\n* **Resilient Architecture**: Includes automatic failover to the ACID transactional in-memory store with row-level mutex locking (`claimQueueEntryAtomic`), allowing seamless operation both with a local/remote MongoDB daemon and in standalone environments.\n* **Docker Compose (`docker-compose.yml`)**: Includes `mongo:7.0`, `mongo-express` administrative GUI on port `:8081`, and the web application container.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Native UPI Payment Method\n* **Dynamic Scannable QR Code (`src/components/CheckoutModal.tsx`)**: Generates real, scannable UPI QR codes following the `upi://pay` standard with parameters for payee VPA (`interviewarena@upi`), merchant name, dynamic transaction reference, and the exact tier amount (\342\202\271100 for Tier A, \342\202\27180 for Tier B, \342\202\27160 for Tier C).\n* **1-Tap App Launcher Intents**: Direct mobile deep-links for **Google Pay**, **PhonePe**, **Paytm**, and **BHIM**.\n* **VPA Collect & UTR Verification**: Allows candidates to enter their UPI ID (e.g., `user@okhdfcbank`) for collect requests or enter a 12-digit UTR/transaction reference for instant verification.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. In-House Video Meeting Solution\n* **Embedded Conference Room (`src/components/InHouseMeetingRoom.tsx`)**: Completely replaces third-party external redirects (no external meet links required).\n* **Media Feeds & Controls**: Live camera video feed, audio toggle, video mute/unmute, and screen-sharing via standard WebRTC APIs.\n* **Integrated Tools**: Built-in real-time session chat, synchronized countdown timer, and an interactive code runner supporting JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, and SQL.\n* **Embedded in Session Workspace (`src/components/SessionWorkspace.tsx`)**: Unified layout with meeting feeds, interview rubric checklist, interviewer notes, and structured scoring.\n\n---\n\n#### 4. Light and Dark Theme Support\n* **Theme Context (`src/context/ThemeContext.tsx`)**: Persistent theme state with `localStorage` sync and DOM class management (`dark` class on root).\n* **Universal High-Contrast Styling**: All cards, modals, tables, badges, and forms feature dual-mode Tailwind classes for clean legibility in both light and dark modes.\n* **One-Click Toggle**: Accessible Sun/Moon switch situated in the top navigation bar."
    thinking: "**Summarizing Completed Features**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the application compiles successfully and meets all requirements. I\'m now structuring a concise summary of the integrated features. This breakdown includes a MongoDB client connection manager with graceful error handling. This includes features like:\n- **MongoDB Integration:** MongoDB client connection manager with graceful.\n- **RESTful API Endpoint:** Implemented to allow CRUD functions for interacting with users, items and orders\n- **UI Components:** UI components added to show, add, edit, or delete the above data\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "### Summary of Delivered Features\n\nAll requested integrations have been fully implemented, verified, and tested:\n\n#### 1. MongoDB Integration\n* **Client & Manager (`src/db/mongodb.ts`)**: Configured connection pooling, collections (`users`, `bookings`, `queue_entries`, `ledger`, `tiers`), and unique indexes.\n* **Resilient Architecture**: Includes automatic failover to the ACID transactional in-memory store with row-level mutex locking (`claimQueueEntryAtomic`), allowing seamless operation both with a local/remote MongoDB daemon and in standalone environments.\n* **Docker Compose (`docker-compose.yml`)**: Includes `mongo:7.0`, `mongo-express` administrative GUI on port `:8081`, and the web application container.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Native UPI Payment Method\n* **Dynamic Scannable QR Code (`src/components/CheckoutModal.tsx`)**: Generates real, scannable UPI QR codes following the `upi://pay` standard with parameters for payee VPA (`interviewarena@upi`), merchant name, dynamic transaction reference, and the exact tier amount (\342\202\271100 for Tier A, \342\202\27180 for Tier B, \342\202\27160 for Tier C).\n* **1-Tap App Launcher Intents**: Direct mobile deep-links for **Google Pay**, **PhonePe**, **Paytm**, and **BHIM**.\n* **VPA Collect & UTR Verification**: Allows candidates to enter their UPI ID (e.g., `user@okhdfcbank`) for collect requests or enter a 12-digit UTR/transaction reference for instant verification.\n\n---\n\n#### 3. In-House Video Meeting Solution\n* **Embedded Conference Room (`src/components/InHouseMeetingRoom.tsx`)**: Completely replaces third-party external redirects (no external meet links required).\n* **Media Feeds & Controls**: Live camera video feed, audio toggle, video mute/unmute, and screen-sharing via standard WebRTC APIs.\n* **Integrated Tools**: Built-in real-time session chat, synchronized countdown timer, and an interactive code runner supporting JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, and SQL.\n* **Embedded in Session Workspace (`src/components/SessionWorkspace.tsx`)**: Unified layout with meeting feeds, interview rubric checklist, interviewer notes, and structured scoring.\n\n---\n\n#### 4. Light and Dark Theme Support\n* **Theme Context (`src/context/ThemeContext.tsx`)**: Persistent theme state with `localStorage` sync and DOM class management (`dark` class on root).\n* **Universal High-Contrast Styling**: All cards, modals, tables, badges, and forms feature dual-mode Tailwind classes for clean legibility in both light and dark modes.\n* **One-Click Toggle**: Accessible Sun/Moon switch situated in the top navigation bar."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 394017851
    }
