  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Authentication System**\n\nI\'m currently focused on incorporating a robust authentication system. This involves designing the login, logout, authentication, and authorization mechanisms. My priority is to securely store all user data in the database. I\'m aiming to ensure that the transition to the homescreen is seamless after publication.\n\n\n**Assessing Production Readiness**\n\nI\'m now shifting gears to evaluate production readiness. I intend to purge dummy data and integrate the application into firebase. My plan involves leveraging `firebase-integration-rpc` to ensure secure data storage, authentication, and role-based access control. I\'m focusing on seamless data migration and error handling.\n\n\n**Evaluating Firebase Integration**\n\nI\'m now assessing how to integrate Firebase, but I must follow specific steps. I\'ve realized the critical need to call `set_up_firebase` with `userConfirmedTermsAcceptedInUI: false` and pause the process immediately to await user confirmation. I\'m focusing on the integration rules in the UI. I can see that the user has not asked for any of these specific tools yet.\n\n\n"
